&#8220;But now,&#8221; he continues, &#8220;out of an abundance of caution and per doctor's orders, because I'm stubborn and I have to listen to them, I'm going to have to take a little bit of time off to to get better. Everything's going to be cool. I cannot wait to join you all and join the cast of this amazing musical. It's just been one of the most extraordinary weeks of my entire life, getting to share this with audiences, and I can't wait to have so many more. And I'll see you all real soon.&#8221;

Galileo began performances at the Shubert Theatre on November 10 (the rehearsal during which Esparza suffered the concussion was November 7).

Park's previous Broadway credits include, among others, Carousel, Smokey Joe's Cafe, Little Me, How To Succeed In Business Without Really Trying, Cat On A Hot Tin Roof, Tuck Everlasting, Dear Evan Hansen and, most recently, 2025's Redwood.

The show's synopsis: The synopsis: &#8220;When luminary Galileo (Esparza) peers into the heavens, what he sees challenges humanity's understanding of the world. Unwilling to deny the truth, Galileo finds himself in a fight with the most powerful institution on Earth. As his trusted confidant Barberini (Kushnier) ascends to power, friendship leads to betrayal, and the dreams Galileo has envisioned for himself and for his brilliant daughter Virginia (Woods) begin to slip away. Belief, ambition, and love pull the trio out of orbit, each confronting what they're willing to sacrifice for what matters most.&#8221; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dl-mid-article-inject2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article2","mid-articleX","mid-article","mid","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[300,250],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

In addition to Esparza and Park, the musical features Jeremy Kushnier, Joy Woods, Bradley Dean, Jordon Lee Garcia and Javier Mu&#xF1;oz. Opening night is Sunday, December 6.

Galileo features a book by Danny Strong and an original score by Zoe Sarnak and Michael Weiner, and is directed by Michael Mayer and choreographed by David Neumann. Producers are Amanda Lipitz, Henry Tisch and Jordan Roth.

Nvidia &#8216;s stock price shot up from a lull after Jensen Huang said on Tuesday he'd be "honored"&#xA0;to return as CEO should the company's board of directors ask him to, his first public statement following his Thursday resignation over a series of affairs.

"Since my departure, I've seen an outpouring of calls from Nvidia's employees, investors, business partners, and customers for me to return as CEO,"&#xA0;he wrote in a statement, which he posted to X. "Many continue to reach out to me directly as the company navigates complex technology, market, competitive, and geopolitical dynamics. Nvidia is a once-in-a-generation company. If the Board of Directors decides that my return is in the best interest of our shareholders, our employees, the company, and America, I would be honored to answer these calls and return as CEO." blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

The statement was first issued to the Wall Street Journal, which posted its story around 10:55 a.m. ET. Nvidia's stock price at the time hovered at $150.09, though it shot up to $155.36 by 11:21 a.m. ET. Nvidia reports its third-quarter earnings for its 2027 fiscal year Tuesday afternoon.

At the end of Only Murders in the Building &#8216; s fifth season, podcaster Cinda Canning ( Tina Fey ) died on the sidewalk in front of the Arconia.

But at the moment of her death, Cinda placed her hand across the building's gate, so as far as Charles ( Steve Martin ), Oliver ( Martin Short ) and Mabel ( Selena Gomez ) are concerned, it counts for purposes of their true crime podcast (also called Only Murders in the Building ). That's the starting point for season six, which premieres Dec. 8.

The events leading up to Cinda's untimely demise, however, took place in London, so the trio heads to England for a new season of the podcast and a chance to take in a new city and new locales. Except when they arrive &#x2014;&#xA0;as shown in the trailer for season six (watch it below) &#x2014; they discover that a key location in Cinda's case is a building that looks an awful lot like the Arconia (&#8220;They even have their own Howard,&#8221; Oliver marvels). blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450],[4,4],[300,251]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories Business Fubo Widens Quarterly Loss on Higher Revenue, Gets to 5.75 Million North America Subscribers TV Jen Affleck Breaks Free: The 'Mormon Wives' Star on Her Divorce and Finding Herself on the 'Orange County' Spinoff

The full description for season six reads, &#8220;Charles, Oliver and Mabel embark on their hardest case yet when the next victim &#x2014; Cinda Canning &#x2014; arrives at their doorstep, summoning them to London to catch her killer. Our beloved trio of true crime-solving podcasters must now navigate their way through the home of the cozy murder mystery, replete with a whole new collection of suspicious and particularly English-eccentric characters. But can they follow in the footsteps of the woman whose podcast started it all for them &#x2026; without having their story end the same as hers?&#8221;

