Martin and showrunner John Hoffman created Only Murders and executive produce season six with Short, Gomez, Dan Fogelman, Jess Rosenthal, Ben Smith, Jennifer Crittenden and Gabrielle Allan.

&#8216;They are here.&#8221; Netflix has released the first trailer for Season 2 of 3 Body Proble m and it opens with an ominous message from the San-Ti . "Hello,&#8221; it begins. &#8220;We haven't spoken with you for a long time, but we've been watching.&#8221;

The message reveals they are sending an emissary to Earth &#8220;in hopes of ending our conflict&#8221; but Thomas Wade (Liam Cunningham), leader of the Planetary Defense Council in charge of protecting Earth, is not buying it. &#8220;Wake up!&#8221;, he warns. &#8220;They haven't come 24 trillion miles to negotiate. They are coming to exterminate us.&#8221;

